etwork activity, and where you are located. This info helps us run our service. You can interact with the Experience by signing up for newsletters or sharing content through social media. We use this info internally to help us improve and report on how we do things. If you don't want cookies, some features might not work. The Netflix family of companies is responsible for your information, but they won't share it without permission unless required by law. You can request access to your personal info or make changes if needed. We'll keep your data as long as necessary and follow the rules in this document. If you don't agree with these rules, we might stop letting you use the Experience.\nThe Netflix family of companies is a registered trademark, and this document explains how they work together. You can contact them at experience@netflix.com if you have questions or concerns about privacy or terms.\n\n### Privacy Policy:\n\nNetflix in Your Neighbourhood respects your personal information and uses it for entertainment purposes only. We collect various types of data from users, including IP addresses, device details, network activity, geolocation, and interactions with the platform. This info helps us run our service internally and report on how we do things. You can interact with the Experience by signing up for newsletters or sharing content through social media plugins. We use this info to help us improve and report on how we do things. If you don't want cookies, some features might not work. The Netflix family of companies is responsible for your information, but they won't share it without permission unless required by law. You can request access to your personal info or make changes if needed. We'll keep your data as long as necessary and follow the rules in this document. If you don't agree with these rules, we might stop letting you use the Experience.\nThe Netflix family of companies is a registered trademark, and this document explains how they work together. You can contact them at experience@net","2945315039":"Welcome to the Netflix in Your Neighborhood Experience! This document outlines our Terms of Use and Privacy Statement for this service. You must be at least 18 years old to interact with it, and its contents are intended for entertainment purposes only.\n\nTo use the Experience, we may collect information such as your IP address, device identifiers, network interactions, geolocation data, email preferences, browser characteristics, referral URLs, and web server logs. We also might send you emails using cookies or other tracking technologies to remember your settings and track your usage.\n\nYour personal information is used for internal operations, content development, performance analysis, and statistical reporting. You can manage your cookie settings in your browser; deleting cookies means losing any preferences managed by them. Social media sharing options allow you to share experiences on platforms like Facebook or Twitter without violating their terms of use.\n\nWe might share your information with Netflix companies, Experience Providers, law enforcement agencies, and other parties for business purposes. You can request access to your personal information, object to processing, restrict data usage, or withdraw consent if you choose. We will not sell your personal information unless prohibited by law.\n\nYou have the right to request deletion of CCPA personal information, receive a copy of it, and exercise rights without discrimination. If you are a consumer under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), you can contact us through an authorized agent who must sign a statement on your behalf. We may not verify requests due to limited data collection.\n\nNetflix is committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring compliance with CCPA regulations.","4018150355":"Your personal information is used for internal operations, content development, performance analysis, and statistical reporting."}}